repository-code: "https://github.com/bsnegara/ssl-cxr-bibliometric"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Replication package for a bibliometric study of semi-supervised learning on
  chest X-rays (Scopus, 2017-2026; 207 records retrieved, 119 retained). It
  contains the search query, gold set, screening decisions by EID, validation
  summary, VOSviewer thesauri, Colab notebooks, aggregated results, and
  extraction coding. Raw Scopus records are not redistributed.
keywords:
  - bibliometric analysis
  - semi-supervised learning
  - chest X-ray
  - class imbalance
  - multi-label classification
  - pseudo-labeling
  - science mapping
